{"id":"e385d16c80a7e662","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-polymorphic-fibration-compat.md","title":"polymorphic-fibration — Compatibility alias","display":"polymorphic-fibration — Compatibility alias","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-polymorphic-fibration-compat","aliases":["16-df-polymorphic-fibration-compat","16-polymorphic-fibration"],"display":"polymorphic-fibration — Compatibility alias","depends_on":["[[16-df-polymorphic-fibration]]"],"revision_date":"2026-10-16","source":"Definition 8.4.1, p. 471 (PDF 491)"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-polymorphic-fibration-compat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-polymorphic-fibration-compat</span><span>16-polymorphic-fibration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"polymorphic-fibration — Compatibility alias"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c8e5d73279cd6c19\" href=\"?note=c8e5d73279cd6c19\" title=\"16-df-polymorphic-fibration\">16-df-polymorphic-fibration</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 8.4.1, p. 471 (PDF 491)"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为候选函子；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolyFib}\">\\(\\mathrm{PolyFib}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c8e5d73279cd6c19\" href=\"?note=c8e5d73279cd6c19\" title=\"16-df-polymorphic-fibration\">16-df-polymorphic-fibration</a> 的基本多态语境结构。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolyFib}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}\">\\(\\mathrm{PolyFib}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}\\)</span> 是下文定义的历史谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolyFib}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{PolyFib}(p).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PolyFib}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{PolyFib}(p).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>兼容入口同步到原书的基本多态纤维化：纤维化、泛对象、纤维有限积与基底有限积。它不自动包含指数或全称类型量词；相应 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda2\">\\(\\lambda2\\)</span> 附加结构另由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LambdaTwoFib}\">\\(\\mathrm{LambdaTwoFib}\\)</span> 表示。</li>\n<li>来源：Definition 8.4.1, p. 471（PDF 491）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-polymorphic-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"c8e5d73279cd6c19","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-polymorphic-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-polymorphic-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"c8e5d73279cd6c19","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为候选函子；$\\mathrm{PolyFib}$ 采用 [[16-df-polymorphic-fibration]] 的基本多态语境结构。$\\mathrm{PolyFib}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}$ 是下文定义的历史谓词。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PolyFib}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PolyFib}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PolyFib}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{PolyFib}(p).","display":true},{"tex":"\\lambda2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LambdaTwoFib}","display":false}],"bytes":1067,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-293","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-polymorphic-fibration-compat|polymorphic-fibration — Compatibility alias]]"}],"outgoing":["c8e5d73279cd6c19"]}